<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<jmeterTestPlan version="1.2" properties="5.0" jmeter="5.6.3">
  <hashTree>
    <TestPlan guiclass="TestPlanGui" testclass="TestPlan" testname="23127262_Load_20260811 - read-heavy (GET /api/products)" enabled="true">
      <stringProp name="TestPlan.comments">Kich ban LOAD tren nhom read-heavy. Run by: 23127262 - Ly Quoc Thanh.
Tham so va ly do:
- 50 thread: backend EShop la Node don luong + SQLite ghi file, 50 nguoi dung dong thoi la muc tai "ngay thuong" hop ly tren may ca nhan; cao hon nua se thanh stress chu khong con la load.
- Ramp-up 60s: khoang 1 thread moi 1.2 giay, tranh cu soc luc khoi dong (cu soc la kich ban Spike, khong phai Load).
- Duration 300s: du dai de qua giai doan khoi dong JIT/cache va lay duoc so lieu on dinh.
- Think time 800ms +/- 200ms: nguoi dung that doc trang roi moi bam tiep, khong ban lien tuc 0ms.
Ghi de tham so khi chay: -Jthreads=.. -Jrampup=.. -Jduration=..</stringProp>
      <boolProp name="TestPlan.functional_mode">false</boolProp>
      <boolProp name="TestPlan.serialize_threadgroups">false</boolProp>
      <elementProp name="TestPlan.user_defined_variables" elementType="Arguments" guiclass="ArgumentsPanel" testclass="Arguments" testname="User Defined Variables" enabled="true">
